---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Home & Auto Insurance Review Nashville | Nashville Insurance Advisors"
  description="Independent home and auto insurance review for Nashville residents. We analyze your current coverage, identify gaps, and help you understand your real exposure — not just your premium."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-navy-300 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gold-400">Home & Auto</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">Home &amp; Auto Insurance</h1>
      <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Most Nashville homeowners have gaps in their coverage they don't know about. We find them before a claim does.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">

        <!-- Primary Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">
            What We Review in Your Home &amp; Auto Coverage
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Your homeowners policy has exclusions buried in it — water damage, jewelry, home offices, trampolines, pools, short-term rentals, business equipment. Most people find out what's not covered when they file a claim and get denied. We read your actual policy, explain what it covers and what it doesn't, and show you where the gaps are before something goes wrong.</p>
            <p>Auto coverage is more complicated than most people realize. Liability limits, uninsured motorist coverage, gap insurance if you're financing, rental reimbursement, roadside — and if you have teenage drivers or let friends borrow your vehicles, your exposure changes significantly. We review your full auto picture the same way we review everything else: together, clearly, no jargon.</p>
            <p>Umbrella coverage is the one most people skip and the one that matters most when something serious happens. If you have a pool, a trampoline, a dog, teenage drivers, or rental property — you need to understand what your liability exposure actually looks like. We'll tell you honestly whether umbrella makes sense for your situation and what it would cost.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Coverage Areas -->
          <div class="mt-12">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Coverage Areas We Review</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              {[
                'Homeowners / Dwelling',
                'Auto (Personal)',
                'Personal Umbrella',
                'Renters Insurance',
                'Scheduled Personal Property',
                'Flood & Earthquake',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-navy-900">{item}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-900 text-white">
              <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Schedule a Review</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-200 text-sm mb-5">
                We'll review your current home and auto policies, identify gaps, and explain your options clearly.
              </p>
              <a
                href="/contact"
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Schedule Your Coverage Review
              </a>
              <a
                href="tel:+16153269899"
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 mt-3 border border-navy-600 hover:border-navy-400 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Call (615) 326-9899
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Related Services</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li><a href="/services/small-business" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Small Business Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/life-annuities" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Life Insurance & Annuities →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/long-term-care" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Long-Term Care →</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
